%% Failed schema-v1 JSON load sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Caller as Application code
  participant API as CanvasEditPort
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Codec as CodecBoundary
  participant Import as Schema v1 import events
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Interaction as InteractionEngine
  participant Selection as SelectionKernel
  participant Projection as DocumentProjectionCache
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Resources as ResourceKernel
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  Caller->>API: loadDocumentFromJson(json)
  API->>Runtime: delegate schema-v1 JSON load
  Runtime->>Runtime: reject disposed or guarded runtime before mutation

  alt runtime is disposed or delivering commit effects
    Runtime--x API: throw StateError
    API--x Caller: rethrow StateError
    Note over Runtime,Signals: Boundary rejection starts no store, cache, repaint, action, or listener effect.
  else runtime accepts public entry
    Runtime->>Codec: parse and validate schema-v1 JSON
    Codec->>Codec: check raw length, JSON shape, schemaVersion, fields, metadata, enums, and transforms

    alt codec validation or import-event read fails
      Codec--x Runtime: CanvasDataException
    else store preparation fails
      Codec->>Import: emit dependency-neutral import events
      Import-->>Store: event stream
      Runtime->>Store: prepare schema-v1 store import
      Store->>Store: check duplicate ids, id admission, final-candidate missing/wrong-kind descriptor relationships, layer order, and sealed image/vector descriptor rows
      Store--x Runtime: CanvasDataException or StateError
    else prepared cleanup fails
      Store-->>Runtime: PreparedStoreDocumentImport
      Runtime->>Interaction: prepare successful load cleanup
      Interaction--x Runtime: StateError
    end

    Runtime--x API: rethrow projected exception
    API--x Caller: rethrow exception

    Note over Runtime,Interaction: Active gesture, preview, pending input, and text editing state remain unchanged.
    Note over Store,Selection: Committed rows, document identity, revisions, selected ids, and selectionRevision remain unchanged.
    Note over Projection,Frame: Projection, spatial, resource, frame caches, and repaint scheduling remain unchanged.
    Note over Signals: No CanvasRuntimeState publication and no CanvasActionCommitted event occur.
  end

  Note over Runtime,Store: Failure stops before prepared store install. There is no partial row install, selection clear, view camera change, revision bump, cache invalidation, or first projection.
